      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add pork roast to the prepared bag; pour brown sugar mixture over roast. Seal bag; place in a roasting pan. Cut several small slits in top of bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
